# A single weak link in an otherwise good chain: it must itself be above a critical value, here between 0.042 and 0.045, slightly more than for a uniform chain.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Chain of 9 with a weak link of 0.045 between sites 4 and 5
sites 9
path 1 9 kappa=0.06
link 4 5 kappa=0.045
kick 1 amplitude=2
run 2500
